

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Next Generation Movement | NGM</title>
<style>
:root{--green:#075c39;--dark:#10151b;--light:#f4f8f5;--gold:#d5a928}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--dark);background:var(--light)}
header{background:var(--dark);color:white;padding:14px 6%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}
header img{width:70px;height:70px;object-fit:contain;background:white;border-radius:8px}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:0 9px;font-size:14px}
.hero{min-height:650px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#063d28dd,#0007),url("chairman-patron.jpeg") center/cover;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:70px 8%;color:white}
.hero div{max-width:650px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,72px);margin:12px 0}.hero p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.6}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:#111;border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
section{padding:65px 8%;max-width:1250px;margin:auto}h2{text-align:center;color:var(--green);font-size:34px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:22px}.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px #0001;line-height:1.7}
.counter{text-align:center;background:var(--green);color:white;padding:35px}.counter strong{display:block;font-size:52px;color:var(--gold)}
form{max-width:850px;margin:auto;background:white;padding:28px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px #0001}
.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px}
label{font-weight:bold;font-size:14px}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #ccd5cf;border-radius:5px}
.full{grid-column:1/-1}.notice{background:#fff8df;border-left:5px solid var(--gold);padding:14px;margin:18px 0;line-height:1.6}
footer{background:var(--dark);color:white;text-align:center;padding:35px 8%;line-height:1.8}
@media(max-width:700px){header{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}nav{width:100%;text-align:center}nav a{display:inline-block;margin:6px 4px}.hero{min-height:560px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <img src="ngm-logo.jpeg" alt="Next Generation Movement logo">
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#objectives">Objectives</a>
    <a href="#leadership">Leadership</a>
    <a href="#register">Join NGM</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p>THE NEXT GENERATION MOVEMENT</p>
    <h1>New Leaders. Stronger Voices. Better Nigeria.</h1>
    <p>Empower. Engage. Transform.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#register">Become a Member</a>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="counter">
  <div>Approved NGM Members</div>
  <strong id="memberCount">0</strong>
</div>
<section id="about">
<h2>About NGM</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>The Next Generation Movement is a nationwide, non-partisan and permanent political mobilization movement committed to ensuring that Nigerian youths participate meaningfully in leadership and governance at every level.</p>
<h3>Our Vision</h3>
<p>A Nigeria where young people are empowered, represented and positioned to lead responsible national transformation.</p>
<h3>Our Mission</h3>
<p>To mobilize, educate, mentor and organize young Nigerians for constructive participation in governance, leadership and community development.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="objectives">
<h2>Aims and Objectives</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Youth Inclusion</h3><p>Promote active representation and appointments for young professionals and youth leaders.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Cross-Party Coalition</h3><p>Support youth-centred candidates and initiatives across political platforms.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Electoral Mobilization</h3><p>Build a grassroots network across Nigeria’s states and the FCT.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Leadership Development</h3><p>Cultivate and mentor responsible political leadership for future generations.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="leadership">
<h2>Leadership</h2>
<div class="card" style="text-align:center">
<img src="chairman-patron.jpeg" alt="NGM Chairman and Patron" style="max-width:320px;width:100%;border-radius:12px">
<h3>Chairman and Patron</h3>
<p>The Next Generation Movement</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="register">
<h2>Membership Registration</h2>
<form id="membershipForm">
<div class="notice">
Your information must be processed through a secure production system. NIN must never be stored in browser storage or sent by ordinary email.
</div>
<div class="fields">
<label>Full Name<input name="name" required></label>
<label>Date of Birth<input type="date" name="dob" required></label>
<label>Nationality<input name="nationality" value="Nigerian" required></label>
<label>State of Origin<input name="state" required></label>
<label>Local Government Area<input name="lga" required></label>
<label>Email Address<input type="email" name="email" required></label>
<label>Phone Number<input type="tel" name="phone" required></label>
<label>NIN<input type="password" name="nin" required autocomplete="off"></label>
<label class="full">Passport Photograph<input type="file" name="photo" accept="image/*" required></label>
<label class="full">
<input type="checkbox" required>
 I agree to the NGM membership terms and the organization’s privacy notice.
</label>
</div>
<br>
<button class="btn" type="submit">Submit Membership Application</button>
<p id="formMessage"></p>
</form>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Membership Terms</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Members commit to supporting youth participation, lawful and peaceful engagement, grassroots action and the long-term development of the Next Generation Movement.</p>
<p>NGM maintains zero tolerance for political violence, hate speech and unlawful conduct.</p>
<p><strong>Declaration:</strong> “We are not waiting for tomorrow. We are the Future, and the Future is Here.”</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<div class="card" style="text-align:center">
<p><strong>Address:</strong> Wuse Zone 6, Abuja, Nigeria</p>
<p><strong>Phone:</strong> +234 701 190 0066</p>
<p><strong>Email:</strong> NextGenerationMovement@gmail.com</p>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>
<strong>The Next Generation Movement</strong><br>
New Leaders. Stronger Voices. Better Nigeria.
</footer>
<script>
const count = document.getElementById("memberCount");
count.textContent = localStorage.getItem("ngmApprovedMembers") || "0";
document.getElementById("membershipForm").addEventListener("submit", function(e){
  e.preventDefault();
  document.getElementById("formMessage").innerHTML =
    "<strong>Application received.</strong> This demo does not yet process or store personal information. Connect it to a secure backend before public use.";
  this.reset();
});
</script>
</body>
</html>


